<title>SINGAPORE: Shell Chemicals opens Singapore research lab.</title>
<headline>Shell Chemicals opens Singapore research lab.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shell Chemicals said in a statement on Tuesday it had opened a research laboratory on Pulau Seraya, an island off Singapore's west coast, to serve as the Asia Pacific centre of its research and development division.</p>
<p>Shell Chemicals is a unit of the Royal Dutch-Shell Corp.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
